# A trend flag arriving on the nurse phone. Run it right after `sim-qa.sh deteriorate`, with
# the nurse app open: one deterioration is one banner and one thing to acknowledge.
activate
tap "Worklist"
# Banners queue. Overdue ones may be ahead of the trend flag.
if "~Overdue:" 2
  tap "Close this notice"
end
if "~Overdue:" 2
  tap "Close this notice"
end
if "~Overdue:" 2
  tap "Close this notice"
end
wait "Trend flag: Sim Deteriorating" 40
shot flag-banner
count "Close this notice" 1
tap "Acknowledge"
wait "Acknowledged"
shot flag-banner-acknowledged
tap "Close this notice"
sleep 2
assertNot "Trend flag: Sim Deteriorating"
tap "Flags"
wait "~Acknowledged, still open"
shot flags-after-acknowledge
tap "Worklist"
